  "blockingFindings": [],
  "reviewConclusions": [
    "SOURCE_CHANGED is emitted only before POST /actions; a single per-query fresh-frame allowance consumes an existing screenshot iteration and never resets deadline or scroll limits. The second source mismatch remains an unqualified partial.",
    "The fresh frame saves PNG/XML, binds validated OCR to PNG hash and dimensions, then reruns native query, advertisement, and ordered-overlap gates. Fresh consent terminates before OCR/another action.",
    "The same-image stall exemption applies only to the no-gesture fresh frame. Measured OCR movement may reset stall counters but never itself supplies rank or list-end proof.",
    "Adaptive motion above 10 percent requires a paired latest PNG/XML receipt, full bounded OCR title, and two distinct native action controls; proof is consumed before the gesture. Next-frame reconciliation remains mandatory.",
    "Clipped-prefix repair preserves an existing occurrence only with a following known matching merchant and consistent measured movement/metadata/native viewport. Raw clipped cards remain unknown; existing ad identity is not converted to organic.",
    "A trailing native ad marker can defer an incomplete bottom header only after all recognized rows and with contained same-list ownership. It adds no merchant, grants no organic rank and forces endOfResults=false. Other unresolved native ad evidence remains fail-closed.",
    "Static action-row detection requires the exact complete Directions/Call/Website hierarchy and direct merchant envelopes; unknown/foreign/disabled/malformed variants remain rejected. Native backward-scroll proof still contradicts an apparent list top.",
    "docs/ci-images.md now uses per-context cwd and --no-logs terminal JSON; ambiguous failure requires exact-invocation identity recovery, never latest-run selection or duplicate enqueue. The root Android.Dockerfile aliases retain the tracked Dockerfile/ignore bytes and include runtime/OCR files under the installed ACR packer."
  ],
